# rules-intro.mp4 is ~180 MB — over Vercel's static file-size limit (~172 MB)
# and stored in Git LFS, so a Vercel build from git would only get the pointer.
# It is kept out of the deploy here; the three in-app references to
# /rules-intro.mp4 need to degrade gracefully (serve it from object storage via
# an env var, or hide the player when absent). See hygiene-05 and the request to
# the front-end owner in review/requests/.
public/rules-intro.mp4

# Build artifacts / deps — Vercel installs + builds remotely.
node_modules
dist
.env
.env.*.local
